          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "For ultralight Mg – Li alloys, the improvement of strength is the most concerned issue. In this work, we suc -cessfully realize the incredible enhancement of strength in the Mg-8.5Li-7.5Zn-1.5Y alloy via a series of prep -aration processes, and the excellent tensile properties containing high yield strength of 312.4 MPa and good elongation of 14.2 % are obtained.",
